  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 433ca407a0ceafe46947512bccfaedf4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: The stones being switched... is that your doing?
  onResponseSelected:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  onResponseFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  subEventPage: {fileID: 0}
  replier: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7fc973e90fac21443b2360d5dcfb5cc3, type: 2}
  reply: Switching the stones. Yes. I remember. The elves, with the orc stone, have
    benefited from his powerful magic, even if its darkness has caused them to seclude
    themselves in their forests. And the orcs, in their own darkness, perhaps have
    found a way to build their community and attain peace, in their own manner. A
    need for balance, you could say.
  reputationAmountToIncrease: 0
  reputationAmountToDecrease: 0
  reputationToAwardMonobehaviourID: {fileID: 0}
