  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c8aa3f3cae44ad24590de72453d413b7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bc4da7ff9ef13fd44b8c44d755b2d27e, type: 2}
  message: Before all this... long ago, I was a powerful being once. A power so great
    it was terrifying to wield. I was plagued by it. And then there were doubts and
    fears... for a long time, I was trapped in my own head with this suffering.
  responses: []
