  replier: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7fc973e90fac21443b2360d5dcfb5cc3, type: 2}
  reply: I can't say for certain. Perhaps they're the nightmares of my own mind...
    my own fears... I find solace in the snow, but I dread the blizzard. Perhaps
    the path to Molok is one of freezing winds and creatures forged from frost.
