  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7fc973e90fac21443b2360d5dcfb5cc3, type: 2}
  message: Ah... yes, my old name. But it matters not... I'm not as powerful anymore.
    Molok has awakened from his slumber. Somewhere within these fragments, he lies,
    slowly regaining his powers. You must find and defeat him. I can mend the stone
    back to its original state, but only if Molok is weakened...
